# PR review replies

**babysit skill etc must always address PR bot feedback where appropriate.**

External reviewers and Qwen/local-LLM are advisory for merge *liveness*
(vendor quota must not block the ship bar), but their substantive feedback is
still mandatory to disposition. Reply in-thread with `Implemented`,
`Deferred`, or `Declined` plus evidence or rationale, then resolve the thread.

Repository CI and `bot-feedback-gate` are required. `bot-presence-gate` is
disabled by default. Run `npm run pr:bot-feedback-audit` for late post-merge
feedback.
